Package: pamflow
Title: End-to-End Passive Acoustic Monitoring Workflow
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Pradeeshwar", "Rajagopal James", email = "pradeeshwarrj@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Standardising passive acoustic recordings, running
    custom BirdNET classifiers, validating detections, and preparing
    occupancy-ready detection histories (Workflow A).
    Standardising passive acoustic recordins, calculating custom list
    of soundscape indices, patterns in soundscape indices, and reporting (Workflow B). 
